\midrule
R1 forward & GE IAC77B801A, 900/5 & 734.6\,A & tap 4\,A = 720\,A & TDS 0.5 / 10 \\
R2 forward & CDG34, 1000/5 & 587.5\,A & plug 300\,A / 600\,A & TMS 0.1 / 1.0 \\
